protective guidelines as mandated by governmental health advisories remain active.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-container_5dde1nr06 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-container_5dde1nr06-d10e31d " data-id="container_5dde1nr06" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="container_5dde1nr06" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-id="container_5dde1nr06"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-container_zqaz0brhi e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-container_zqaz0brhi-9e783da " data-id="container_zqaz0brhi" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="container_zqaz0brhi" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-id="container_zqaz0brhi"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-widget_p9ncjjx9l elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="widget_p9ncjjx9l" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon.default"><div class="elementor-icon-wrapper"><div class="elementor-icon"> <svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-exclamation-triangle" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M569.517 440.013C587.975 472.007 564.806 512 527.94 512H48.054c-36.937 0-59.999-40.055-41.577-71.987L246.423 23.985c18.467-32.009 64.72-31.951 83.154 0l239.94 416.028zM288 354c-25.405 0-46 20.595-46 46s20.595 46 46 46 46-20.595 46-46-20.595-46-46-46zm-43.673-165.346l7.418 136c.347 6.364 5.609 11.346 11.982 11.346h48.546c6.373 0 11.635-4.982 11.982-11.346l7.418-136c.375-6.874-5.098-12.654-11.982-12.654h-63.383c-6.884 0-12.356 5.78-11.981 12.654z"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 data-interaction-id="widget_jzgsf0skt" class="e-widget_jzgsf0skt-98bd2f4 e-heading-base" data-e-type="widget" data-id="widget_jzgsf0skt">Prohibition of Ragging</h3><h6 data-interaction-id="widget_3w599k9ud" class="e-widget_3w599k9ud-e85e54d e-heading-base" data-e-type="widget" data-id="widget_3w599k9ud">CRIMINAL OFFENSE