mentor-icon-list-text">About AIT-SAP</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-420f41fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="420f41fc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-69ce6ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="69ce6ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1e692d35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="1e692d35" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default"><div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="161" class="elementor elementor-161" data-elementor-post-type="page"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7d3e120 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="7d3e120" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b335c69 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b335c69" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-655035b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="655035b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">About Apeejay Education</h4></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-68f3830 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="68f3830" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p><strong>Apeejay Education</strong> is committed to excellence and has over the years, set up a wide and useful network of schools, colleges and institutions in various parts of the country, in its endeavour to bring quality education at all levels. The main objective is to provide the students not only ‘education for living &amp; livelihood&#8217; but also ‘Education for Life&#8217; by focusing on the inculcation of human and moral values through the curriculum.</p><p>Apeejay Education’s Achievements is in empowering learners and providing them with world-class education coupled with a fundamental foundation in leadership and professional skills to face the new liberalized global economy. The Apeejay Institute of Technology has been set up amidst a sprawling green campus in Greater Noida. The School of Architecture &amp; Planning was one of the first schools to come up here.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-110d434 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="110d434" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d93d0ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="d93d0ba" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"> <a href="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo.webp" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="Building Photo" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MzI5LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvd3d3LmFwZWVqYXkuZWR1XC9hcmNoaXRlY3R1cmVcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjZcLzA3XC9CdWlsZGluZy1QaG90by53ZWJwIn0%3D"> <img fetchpriority="high" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1920" height="1280" src="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-329" alt="" srcset="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo.webp 1920w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo-768x512.webp 768w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Building-Photo-1536x1024.webp 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /> </a></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f10cfc4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="f10cfc4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cb4ebb8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="cb4ebb8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a3f613a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="a3f613a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">About the Campus AIT SAP</h4></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0df7e36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0df7e36" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>The campus, about 2 kms. from <strong>Pari Chowk</strong> on <strong>Noida-Greater Noida expressway</strong>, is a part of the Institutional Area of Greater Noida &#8211; a modern, well planned and fast growing city. It shall offer the students a lifetime opportunity to witness the growth and development of a new settlement, enabling pragmatic visions on architectural ideas, urban design and landscape design. It is well connected to Noida, Delhi and other surrounding areas by road network. Regular frequent bus service is available from N. Delhi/Noida to Apeejay Campus, Greater Noida.</p><p>The School of Architecture &amp; Planning is an integral constituent of the Apeejay Institute of Technology situated in Greater Noida, Dist. Gautam Budh Nagar, U.P. India. The Apeejay campus occupies an area of 29.0 acres. The campus also has residential facility for the students and the faculty members, thus fostering a healthy interface for learning. Campus is enabled with Wi-fi facilities.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15616cd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="15616cd" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bbff826 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="bbff826" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"> <a href="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/building.webp" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="building" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MzI4LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvd3d3LmFwZWVqYXkuZWR1XC9hcmNoaXRlY3R1cmVcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjZcLzA3XC9idWlsZGluZy53ZWJwIn0%3D"> <img decoding="async" width="816" height="612" src="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/building.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-328" alt="" srcset="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/building.webp 816w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/building-300x225.webp 300w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/building-768x576.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 816px) 100vw, 816px" /> </a></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-06b7a52 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="06b7a52" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2721498 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2721498" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-335ddc7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="335ddc7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">About AIT SAP</h4></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0b12860 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0b12860" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>The School of Architecture &amp; Planning is committed to impart comprehensive knowledge and training to create a pool of Architects geared to meet the challenges of buildings/habitat posed by the new millennium.</p><p>The School was formerly inaugurated in October 1999 to coincide with initiation of classes for B.Arch 1 st year under the aegis of Dr. B.R. Ambedkar University, Agra . Starting with academic session 2000-2001, the B.Arch. Course has been affiliated to the U.P. Technical University, Lucknow. School of Architecture &amp; Planning has been meeting all norms and standards of education stipulated by COA and has been granted regular extension to conduct <strong>BACHELOR OF ARCHITECTURE</strong> course. The School of Architecture &amp; Planning has currently the <strong>approval of AKTU</strong> for the intake of <strong>40 students.</strong></p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3a7046a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3a7046a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c6ccff elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2c6ccff" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"> <a href="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT.webp" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="AboutSIT" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MzA0LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvd3d3LmFwZWVqYXkuZWR1XC9hcmNoaXRlY3R1cmVcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjZcLzA3XC9BYm91dFNJVC53ZWJwIn0%3D"> <img decoding="async" width="1920" height="864" src="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-304" alt="About AIT-SAP" srcset="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT.webp 1920w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT-300x135.webp 300w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT-1024x461.webp 1024w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT-768x346.webp 768w, https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AboutSIT-1536x691.webp 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /> </a></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-95c40eb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="95c40eb" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e149147 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e149147" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0e834a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="0e834a8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Vision</h4></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7ca56c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7ca56c9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>The Department of Architecture envisages to be recognized as a role model in advanced fields of Architectural Education and Research and to cater the futuristic approach, professional demands and social needs at a global level.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-216502a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="216502a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d8930b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d8930b6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Mission</h4></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e60808e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e60808e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><ul><li>Educate, Motivate and prepare the students to know the Fundamental and Technical Skills in Architecture through effective teaching-learning methodologies.</li><li>To imbibe Professional and Ethical Standards in the minds of the young architects through continuous learning and professional activities.</li><li>To impart Employability Skills to the students for being industry ready by implanting training and site visits.</li><li>To create Entrepreneurship Skills by industrial collaborations and mentoring.</li><li>To encourage students to undertake R&amp;D activities for societal needs with high ethical standards.</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1db2079 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="1db2079" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-908d4fc elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="908d4fc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-box.default"><div class="elementor-icon-box-wrapper"><div class="elementor-icon-box-icon"> <a href="https://www.apeejay.edu/architecture/programme/bachelor-of-architecture-b-arch/" class="elementor-icon" tabindex="-1" aria-label="B.Arch"> <svg aria-hidden=