ementor-icon-list-text">Recognition Status</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-420f41fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="420f41fc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-69ce6ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="69ce6ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1e692d35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="1e692d35" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default"><div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="189" class="elementor elementor-189" data-elementor-post-type="page"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2829a39 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2829a39" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3b6f6e6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3b6f6e6b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Apeejay Institute of Technology – School of Architecture &amp; Planning (AIT-SAP), Greater Noida, is committed to delivering quality architectural education in accordance with the standards and regulations prescribed by the statutory authorities. The Institute continuously strives to maintain academic excellence, professional ethics, and compliance with all regulatory requirements.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Bachelor of Architecture (B.Arch.) and Master of Architecture (M.Arch.) programmes offered by the Institute are recognized and conducted with the necessary approvals from the concerned regulatory bodies. The Institute is affiliated with <strong>Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), Lucknow</strong>, and the architecture programmes are approved by the <strong>Council of Architecture (COA), New Delhi</strong>, the statutory body responsible for regulating architectural education and the profession in India.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Institute regularly receives the required <strong>Extension of Approval (EOA)</strong> and ensures compliance with the academic, infrastructural, faculty, and administrative standards prescribed by the regulatory authorities.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Regulatory Authorities</h3><h4 class="wp-block-heading">Council of Architecture (COA)</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Council of Architecture (COA), constituted under the Architects Act, 1972, is the statutory body responsible for regulating architectural education and the profession in India. It prescribes minimum standards of education, monitors compliance, and grants approval to institutions offering architecture programmes.</p><h4 class="wp-block-heading">Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU)</h4><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), Lucknow, is the affiliating university of the Institute. The University oversees the academic curriculum, examinations, and quality standards for technical and professional education.</p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1bab1e2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="1bab1e2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a1c0ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7a1c0ec" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9725ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9725ee8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h5 class="wp-block-heading">Recogni